      "created_at": "2013-07-13T04:39:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is a hostel in Broad Ripple. It's five miles from the con, so you will be commuting in and out every day. If you do that, I recommend parking in the mall garage. At least in past years, if you left late enough (after midnight? 1am?), they stopped manning the booths and you could just drive out w/out paying.</p>",
