      "created_at": "2013-08-02T20:18:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The friend I was going to split the cost with can't go now and I find myself with the sudden burden of paying for everything myself, which to be honest sucks. &nbsp;So I can't afford a hotel/motel and would like to know if anyone would like to let me crash on their floor. I can pay a small fee, of course, to help assuage the cost of the room.</p><p>Any help anyone can provide would be greatly appreciated.</p>",
